TITLE Mix 1:1 DIC and Ca, heat to 200C with calcite equilibrium
SOLUTION 1
    temp      20
    units     mol/kgw
    pH        7
    C(4)      0.05
SOLUTION 2
    temp      20
    units     mol/kgw
    pH        7
    Ca        0.05
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 38 56 74 92 110 128 146 164 182 200
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
